Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:20.29,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,OKF 淘汰賽終於要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.67,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,最強的男子漢玩家會是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:26.55,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼 預賽開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:30.55,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.67,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳不緊張嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:35.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯… 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:37.42,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳的牙齒都在打顫了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.65,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,要… 要冷靜點 深呼吸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.43,0:00:44.59,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,加賀同學也緊張嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:46.58,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,加賀同學？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:47.44,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:50.44,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳剛才在發呆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:51.90,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:55.45,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,沒什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:57.70,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,總之就好好享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:00.20,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,說的也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:04.19,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,A 區的選手請移動到指定地點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.43,0:01:06.47,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我們也該過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:07.75,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,加… 加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:10.47,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,嗯 待會見
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.03,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我絕對會拿下冠軍的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.40,Top,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,A 區的選手請到這邊來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:54.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯… A-3 的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:55.68,Text,Gamer A,0,0,0,,喂 你聽說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:59.58,Text,Gamer A,0,0,0,,這次大賽好像有其他地區的知名格鬥玩家來參加
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:01.90,Text,Gamer B,0,0,0,,好像是 真讓人躍躍欲試
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.92,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我的對手會是什麼樣的人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:06.81,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:08.54,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉… 莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.00,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:13.04,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒想到第一戰就對上莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:17.04,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我知道莉莉為了今天練習了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:20.72,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,145)}我還是為了幫她加油才一起報名參賽的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.14,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:25.27,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,就算我放水 莉莉應該也不會開心吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:31.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,說的也是 正因為是這種時候才要全力以赴！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.85,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,因為我們是朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:38.06,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼 A 區第一戰 開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:41.78,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:46.10,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.72,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,葵衣… 加油…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.26,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,請往這邊走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:51.78,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我的心好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:56.12,Text,Otokogi Koala,0,0,0,,OKF 淘汰賽正式開幕！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:04:00.77,Text,Otokogi Koala,0,0,0,,格鬥玩家們的戰鬥也逐漸白熱化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:06.34,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,好的 B 區備受矚目的兩位選手終於要正面交鋒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:09.35,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,眼鏡前輩 VS 數據選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.65,0:04:11.35,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.64,Text,Data,0,0,0,,你的數據我都掌握了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:17.49,Text,Data,0,0,0,,我的勝率是 99.9%
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:19.73,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,格鬥遊戲可不只看數據
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:24.30,Text,Data,0,0,0,,格鬥遊戲有 97.6% 的可能性只看數據
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.96,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,哦哦！ 角色設定好像有點重複！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:29.86,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,推眼鏡大戰爆發啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:33.54,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,解說員草壁先生 您怎麼看這場比賽？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:37.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,目前為止推眼鏡的速度完全不分軒輊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:39.92,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,預計會是一場激烈的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.91,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,也就是說 這將會是一場難以預料的對決呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.86,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,真讓人期待這場比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.93,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼 B 區第三戰 比賽開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:54.05,Text,Data,0,0,0,,應付不過來！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:56.31,Text,Data,0,0,0,,這… 這種事我的數據裡沒有啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:59.99,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,我說過了吧 格鬥遊戲可不只看數據！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.44,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.44,Text,Data,0,0,0,,怎麼可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:06.19,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,勝者 眼鏡前輩！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:09.21,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,呼… 好險
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:11.21,Text,KSK,0,0,0,,數據選手被打敗了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:17.09,Text,Kokujin,0,0,0,,哼 那傢伙可是我們格鬥遊戲四天王中最強的玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:19.47,Text,Aru,0,0,0,,這次大賽的水準很高啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:21.59,Text,KSK,0,0,0,,我們也得加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:25.46,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,今天來的怪人還真多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.98,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,雖然總算是晉級了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:32.98,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,看… 看起來好強…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:37.48,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,好的 A 區第三戰 這也是一場值得關注的比賽！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:41.48,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,雨時晴選手 VS 葵衣選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.73,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,超受矚目的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:47.36,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,您認為這場對戰會如何發展
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:51.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯 雨時晴選手是經驗老道的格鬥玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:55.96,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,遊戲經歷尚淺的葵衣選手 能將經驗差距
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.25,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,彌補到什麼程度 將會是勝負的關鍵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.13,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,你說得倒輕鬆…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:02.22,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.14,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,請… 請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:08.01,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,畢竟我贏了莉莉 就盡力打到最後吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:11.50,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼 A 區第三戰 開始！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.76,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.67,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,唉… 一下子就輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:17.60,Top,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,這位小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.98,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,是場很棒的比賽！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:21.65,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,妳很晴朗呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:23.78,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,哦哦 是晴天宣言！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:28.64,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這是在幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:30.91,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,謝… 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.21,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,出… 出現了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:36.55,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,是雨立！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:38.42,Text,Gamer B,0,0,0,,是本尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:40.55,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,到底是在幹嘛啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:47.42,Text,Otokogi Koala,0,0,0,,就這樣 經過數場激戰 預賽也終於進入尾聲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.76,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,D 區的最終戰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:53.33,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,能拿下決賽門票的會是哪位選手呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:58.68,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,一邊是至今的比賽中完全沒讓對手有可趁之機的實力派 花梨選手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.68,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:06.96,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,另一邊則是隔壁鎮最強的格鬥玩家 蒙著眼睛卻能看透一切的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.67,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,蒙眼選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.08,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,這可是個不得了的對戰組合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.62,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,草壁先生 您覺得結果會如何
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:19.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,值得關注的是蒙眼選手能否看穿花梨選手多樣化的攻勢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:25.42,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,原來如此 根據這邊的資料 蒙眼選手的視力是 2.0
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.70,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,讓我們期待他的洞察力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:30.42,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,決賽的門票是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.46,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,因為我超強的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:35.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父 別輸給那種傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:41.59,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼 D 區最終戰 開始！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.22,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:47.13,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,勝者是花梨選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:50.99,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,她的動作… 我看不見…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:57.00,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,看來即使是蒙眼選手也無法用眼睛跟上花梨選手的攻擊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:59.50,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那是因為你戴著那種東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,恭喜妳 師父！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.58,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,晉級決賽好厲害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.51,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,沒拿到冠軍就沒意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.01,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:09.50,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,A 區比賽結束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:16.76,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,沒想到雨時晴選手竟然敗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:20.76,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,看來決賽也不是省油的燈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:29.22,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,雖然沒能進決賽 但參加這種大賽也還不錯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:30.54,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真緊張刺激呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.77,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:35.78,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,下次有大賽的話我們再練習一起參加吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:36.71,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:39.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,希望下次不要再對上莉莉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,再來就是幫加賀同學加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:43.98,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,說起來師父呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:44.79,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:47.42,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不知不覺間就不見了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.10,0:08:52.54,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳要我也參加 OKF 大賽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:56.10,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,是啊 這是個對戰的絕佳場所吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:09:00.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,雖然很抱歉 但因為我是店員 所以不能參加大賽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:03.24,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,你是說跟比你弱的對手打提不起勁嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:05.82,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃… 不 我不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:10.70,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,既然如此 要是我在那場大賽上拿到冠軍 你這次就跟我對戰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:14.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,為什麼妳要這麼執著於跟我打
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:20.45,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我覺得如果不打贏你 總有一天會遇到瓶頸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:23.95,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,所以… 拜託你 我求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:24.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.42,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,喂 快把頭抬起來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.71,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,在你答應之前我不會抬起來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:30.34,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我… 我知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.80,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,就照那個條件跟你對戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.21,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,說定了喔 小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.97,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我要在大賽上拿到冠軍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:39.96,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,然後！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:42.98,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我絕對要打贏小哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:46.98,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼 在決賽開始前 先進入休息時間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:10:00.66,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼決賽要開始囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:04.75,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,首先來介紹出場的選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:09.21,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,能冷靜地使出精準無比連段的 眼鏡選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:13.22,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那副一直滑下來的眼鏡尺寸真的合嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:15.01,Top,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,這只是我的習慣而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.37,0:10:18.10,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,外表輕浮 但實際上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:21.84,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,以穩健的打法確實拿下勝利的 後輩選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:22.46,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:27.22,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,他能否對既是前輩也是師父的眼鏡選手下剋上呢！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:29.14,Top,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,我的選手名是「後輩」嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.43,0:10:33.27,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,雖然是國中生 卻以壓倒性的玩家技巧輾壓他人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:36.33,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,讓觀眾為之著迷的花梨選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:38.90,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:42.64,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,最後是本次大賽的黑馬！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:45.31,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,遊戲經歷只有一個月的新人玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:49.58,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,也是最近剛結束本店打工研修期的 桃子選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:53.29,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,哦 是她啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.26,0:10:56.91,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這位大姊姊打贏了那個人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:11:00.43,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,喂！ 不是說店員不能參加嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.43,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,桃子選手今天沒有排班
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.23,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,這樣也行喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:06.94,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,那… 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:10.94,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,我也會全力以赴的 請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:13.00,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,哦… 喔 請多指教…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:15.77,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,是說這位大姊進決賽了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:18.06,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,明明看起來不怎麼強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:21.94,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼 現在來發表決賽的對戰組合！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:25.72,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,花梨選手 VS 後輩選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.84,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,我也要拿出好表現才行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:31.86,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,桃子選手 VS 眼鏡選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:33.58,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,請多指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:37.64,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼決賽 比賽開始！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.86,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:42.85,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,勝負已定！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:45.46,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,勝者 花梨選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:47.71,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,被秒殺了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:51.22,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.99,0:11:53.98,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那邊怎麼樣了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:01.06,Text,Data,0,0,0,,那兩個人經驗差距很大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:04.87,Text,Data,0,0,0,,眼鏡選手的勝率是 99.9%！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:07.02,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,正常來說是這樣沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:09.53,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,是雨是晴 馬上就會揭曉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.75,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,都是些很有個性的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.99,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼比賽開始！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.66,0:12:20.25,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:23.00,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,勝者 桃子選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:26.06,Text,Data,0,0,0,,怎麼可能 這數據裡沒有啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:28.43,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,完全看不見她的動作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:30.64,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,她果然很晴朗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:33.63,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,人類性能差太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.89,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,人類性能？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.89,0:12:37.86,Text,Otokogi Koala,0,0,0,,待我來說明！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:42.38,Text,Otokogi Koala,0,0,0,,所謂人類性能 是指反應速度… 操作技術…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:46.16,Text,Otokogi Koala,0,0,0,,精神力等遊戲天分的總稱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:49.65,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,恐怕是她從劍道培養出的高體能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:52.65,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,也影響了她的遊戲天分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.67,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,哦 有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:13:00.93,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,就讓妳當我跟小哥對戰前的最後暖身對手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:02.43,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:06.36,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,決賽竟然是女性對決！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:09.18,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,究竟勝利女神會對誰微笑呢！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:12.44,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,該幫誰加油才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真是個難題呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:18.07,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,草壁先生 您覺得最後的戰況會如何發展
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:22.07,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,兩位選手都擁有非常高超的實力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:25.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我認為誰能將對手捲入自己的節奏中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:27.31,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,誰就能拿下勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:35.73,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,原來如此 也就是壓倒性的遊戲技巧 VS 壓倒性的人類性能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:39.16,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,來吧 這場勝負究竟鹿死誰手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:43.18,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,那麼最終戰 開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:45.17,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:46.97,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,是狗狗使用者啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:50.67,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,性能雖然很高 卻是個很難操作的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:54.44,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,就算再有天分 應該也還使不出連段
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:58.50,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,只要警戒判定強的招式 再抓準時機反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:13:59.93,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,就不是什麼可怕的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:01.44,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:03.93,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,就在這裡反擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.69,0:14:06.69,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,什麼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.19,0:14:10.44,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,她竟然能確實打出連段！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.71,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,哦哦 桃子選手的猛攻！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.52,0:14:18.21,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:21.97,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,桃子選手先拿下一局！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:24.83,Text,Aru,0,0,0,,用超難的連段一口氣解決了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:28.80,Text,Kokujin,0,0,0,,那個大姊真的只有一個月遊戲經歷嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:31.59,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,能照著練習的成果打出來真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:33.49,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,草壁先生 剛才那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:38.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,看來是桃子選手在心理戰上贏過了想抓反擊的花梨選手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:41.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,連段的選擇和精準度也都很出色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:45.22,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,沒想到會是這麼一面倒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:47.61,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,她是個不得了的新人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:49.55,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父能贏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:51.85,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯… 很難說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:54.13,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,照這樣下去很難說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:59.16,Text,Data,0,0,0,,桃子選手的動作超越了數據！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:02.63,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,身為隔壁鎮最強的我 竟然也跟不上她的動作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:06.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父會輸掉嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:08.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不 還沒結束！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:11.34,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Round two.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.09,0:15:12.88,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:17.75,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,哦哦 花梨選手這次一改作風 轉為猛攻！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.64,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,她要強勢進攻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.58,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我真是個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:25.65,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,打安全牌 採取不習慣的防守戰術根本不適合我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:29.13,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,進攻… {\alpha&HFF&\t(700,700,\alpha&H00&)}進攻… {\alpha&HFF&\t(1500,1500,\alpha&H00&)}進攻… {\alpha&HFF&\t(2200,2200,\alpha&H00&)}進攻！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:33.16,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不給對手喘息的機會 把節奏掌握在自己手上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:35.16,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,然後壓倒她！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.59,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,這才是我的風格啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.59,0:15:39.27,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:44.20,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,維持著進攻的態勢 就這樣拿下勝利！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:47.91,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,花梨選手展現了女帝的風範！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.72,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那是什麼丟臉的稱號
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:51.71,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,加賀同學好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.71,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,哼… 放晴了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:55.22,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,太扯了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:57.51,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,竟然能在那種情況下扳回一城
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:16:01.23,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,最終戰會怎麼發展已經完全無法預測了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:06.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,第二戰的勝因是花梨選手找回了自己原本的風格
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:07.48,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:12.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是的 花梨選手原本就擅長進攻的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:13.99,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,原來如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.48,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,這樣雙方就各拿下一局了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:19.99,Top,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,究竟誰會獲勝呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:21.83,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Round three.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.83,0:16:22.60,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:24.74,Text,Kokujin,0,0,0,,又來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.86,0:16:27.49,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,桃子選手反擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.49,0:16:29.97,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,這麼快就應對過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:34.38,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.38,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,並不是喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.37,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,蓮司君 那個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:39.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是遊戲機制
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:40.32,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,BUG 招式…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:41.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是遊戲機制
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.11,0:16:44.86,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:57.82,Text,Data,0,0,0,,這種事… 數據裡沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:16:59.26,Text,Data,0,0,0,,不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:10.50,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,呃… 那麼比賽繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:12.49,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Round four.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.00,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:58.64,Text,Game,0,0,0,,Round nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.05,Text,Game,0,0,0,,最終決戰！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.05,Text-English,Game,0,0,0,,Final showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:14.85,Comment,Game,0,0,0,,※ 英式橄欖球（Rugby Union）爭球的開球口令
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:02.27,Text,Game,0,0,0,,準備！
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.05,0:18:02.27,Text-English,Game,0,0,0,,Crouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:05.06,Text,Game,0,0,0,,接觸
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.05,0:18:05.06,Text-English,Game,0,0,0,,Touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:07.93,Text,Game,0,0,0,,停頓
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.49,0:18:07.93,Text-English,Game,0,0,0,,Pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.75,0:18:14.85,Text,Game,0,0,0,,交戰！
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.75,0:18:14.85,Text-English,Game,0,0,0,,Engage!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.37,0:19:47.86,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:50.60,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,比賽結束！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:54.38,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,拿下最終戰勝利的是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.94,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,花梨選手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:57.87,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,太厲害了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:02.82,Text,The Blindfold,0,0,0,,沒想到這座城市裡有這麼強又這麼聰明的格鬥玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.13,Text,Rainy with a Chance of Sunshine,0,0,0,,萬里晴空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:06.23,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:07.15,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.15,0:20:10.65,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,加賀同學好強… 我輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.65,0:20:19.73,Text,Kokujin,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:21.89,Text,KSK,0,0,0,,我們也得更努力練習才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.89,0:20:24.90,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,請問加賀同學在哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:26.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊 是桃子！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:29.66,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,加賀同學在大賽結束後就馬上不知道跑去哪了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:35.42,Text,Momoko,0,0,0,,這樣啊 我還想說最後能跟加賀同學聊聊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:39.93,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,這房間是？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.45,0:20:43.93,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這裡是放著測試用機台
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.43,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,的相關人員專用房間
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.33,0:20:50.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,也就是說 在這裡不會有人打擾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:52.07,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,也就是說！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.07,0:20:54.39,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯 恭喜妳拿到冠軍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:55.80,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我會遵守約定的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:58.31,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,終於能跟小哥對戰了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:00.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那麼 開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:08.61,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Round one.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.61,0:21:09.45,Top,Game,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.83,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 加賀同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:15.13,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:17.08,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,還以為妳已經回去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.68,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,抱歉啦 我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊… 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.09,0:21:29.11,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.11,0:21:31.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？ 加賀同學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:37.31,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,害師父哭的人 我要去打倒他！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:39.48,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那可能有點困難喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:45.02,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,得從根本上重新檢視我的打法才行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.02,0:21:46.48,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,連段… 防禦…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.30,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,全部！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:53.19,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,可… 可惡…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:57.01,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,下次我不會輸的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:02.38,Text,Otokogi Koala,0,0,0,,她的戰鬥才正要開始！
